An adventure simulator for fans of trading and games like Animal Crossing. Download Mineko's Night Market Download the torrent for free in Russian and immerse yourself in exciting exploration, crafting, and historical learning.

The game's protagonist is an inquisitive girl named Mineko, who moved to a new home on a Japanese island near Mount Fugu. The local population is quite superstitious, choosing a Sun Cat named Abe as their deity. Many considered the legendary animal to be nothing more than a myth, but stories and evidence continually surface that the "god" has begun to manifest itself.

Mineko's Night Market Invites you to immerse yourself in the town's history, uncovering its secrets while also dealing with everyday worries. Complete main quests, solve unique puzzles and riddles, and create unique items to trade at the weekly night market.

The game introduces Japanese culture, presenting it in a positive light. It also touches on important topics such as friendship, rituals, customs, and beliefs. And, of course, there are plenty of cats to look forward to.

Key features:
- wander around the town and its surroundings, find valuable resources and items, make good acquaintances;
- rare resources allow you to create items with unique properties;
- Bartering with locals at the weekly night market will earn you money, so become a master of your craft and offer only high-quality goods;
- take part in games and competitions that will add variety to your leisure time: these include animal racing, sumo wrestling, and many other interesting things;
- discover the secret of the mysterious deity Abe and the island itself.

Installation:
1. Unpack the archive (make sure the folder path has Latin characters only).
2. Run the game.
